WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.693
This query groups the sales source by product and
month COUNT tells us

00:00:05.719 --> 00:00:11.431
how many transaction rows exist in each
product-month group SUM shows

00:00:11.457 --> 00:00:17.015
the total revenue that would fill a pivot cell Look
for groups where source

00:00:17.041 --> 00:00:23.226
rows is greater than one Those groups prove that the
pivot requires aggregation
